\"87f4e115bf0f1121\" href=\"?note=87f4e115bf0f1121\" title=\"67-thm-godel-second-incompleteness\">67-thm-godel-second-incompleteness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c333dbc176d20e8\" href=\"?note=5c333dbc176d20e8\" title=\"67-df-reflexive-theory\">67-df-reflexive-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"650dc4b8018183d7\" href=\"?note=650dc4b8018183d7\" title=\"67-df-finite-subtheory\">67-df-finite-subtheory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 6 章 §1，Theorem 3，印刷页 77；PDF 第 88 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"已核对原书短证明及假设；第二不完备性和表示转移采用所列上游结果"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是一致、原始递归 PA 扩张，采用本册固定编码和证明算术化。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd\">\\(\\unlhd\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d8841239c5b611fa\" href=\"?note=d8841239c5b611fa\" title=\"67-thm-interpretability-numeration-transfer\">67-thm-interpretability-numeration-transfer</a> 所用接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的有限公理子集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[T]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\([T]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 是所有这类子集的集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本条的固定编号为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a329235da6144513\" href=\"?note=a329235da6144513\" title=\"67-df-strong-godel-encoding\">67-df-strong-godel-encoding</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_{L_A}\">\\(g=c_{L_A}\\)</span>。每个出现的有效理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 绑定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a> 的呈示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_A\">\\(E_A\\)</span>；使用内部证明公式时固定同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span> 及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})\">\\(\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{A,E_A}(\\mathrm{Prf}_A,e_{\\mathrm{prf},A})\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall F\\in[T]^{&lt;\\omega}\\quad\\neg(T\\unlhd F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall F\\in[T]^{&lt;\\omega}\\quad\\neg(T\\unlhd F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\unlhd F\">\\(T\\unlhd F\\)</span>，Theorem 1 给某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{F}\\to\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_{F}\\to\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 反身，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 包含在某个代码有界片段中，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_F\">\\(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_F\\)</span>，进而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau\">\\(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_\\tau\\)</span>，违反第二不完备性。</p>\n<p>“有限子理论”在此指任意有限公理子集，不仅是某个特定截断 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\upharpoonright k\">\\(T\\upharpoonright k\\)</span>；从代码片段穷竭到任意有限子集的步骤已明确记录。PDF 第 88 页图像及证明已读。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，原档案所引 Cambridge/ASL 2016 重印本 PDF；第 6 章 §1，Theorem 3，印刷页 77；PDF 第 88 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：已核对原书短证明及假设；第二不完备性和表示转移采用所列上游结果。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-thm-interpretability-numeration-transfer","status":"resolved","id":"d8841239c5b611fa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-interpretability-numeration-transfer]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-godel-second-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"87f4e115bf0f1121","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-godel-second-incompleteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-reflexive-theory","status":"resolved","id":"5c333dbc176d20e8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-reflexive-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-finite-subtheory","status":"resolved","id":"650dc4b8018183d7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnc